# Allow-list: only the build inputs reach the build context. Everything else
# (.git, the git-ignored temp/ reference checkouts, editor files, env files,
# credentials, logs, build output, documentation) stays on the host.
*
!Dockerfile
!prime-agent-container.patch
!build/
!rootfs/
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
# Never ship residue from inside the allowed directories either.
build/**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*~
**/.env
**/.env.*
